     "classification": "parity",
     "method": "Diagnostic iteratively reweighted pressure residual fit using printed pressure errors and volume errors propagated through dP/dV; the paper's exact Angel (2000) weighting configuration is not stated, so this is not substituted for the published record.",
     "parameters": {
      "V0_fixed": 162.86,
      "K0": 237.18599457,
      "K0_prime_fixed": 4.0
