   "notes": "This resource contains source-reported shock inputs and reductions, not static states. Flyer velocity, initial density, shock transit velocity, and the three populated pyrometric temperatures are measured; particle velocity, pressure, and shocked density are derived by impedance matching and Rankine-Hugoniot relations; phase_state is interpreted. Parenthesized values are retained as generic published uncertainties because the table does not specify their statistic. Five rows originate in Akins and Luo; the 245.4 GPa aggregate experiment is new in this paper.",
